  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>This macro allows you to do a fast backward rainbow flick in the roblox game "Locked". With a 5'3 build you're able to flick backward very fast allowing you to trick your opponent on where the ball is going. This macro works perfect on 0.2 roblox sens and 0.62 ingame locked sens. You must use 1920x1080 to use this macro</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
